    "body": "well, maybe it's not a duplicate. this strange stuck behabior is happened on my Windows Terminal, PowerShell, with `scoop install starship`. I'm not use WSL2 since I'm only at Windows 10 1909. and I tested with Windows PowerShell terminal, it's still stuck after any commend, even nothing is typed.\r\n\r\nJust guessing, but the only special thing on my device, I suppose, is I manually enabled the Windows currently Beta support for Unicode. maybe this bug have something to do with it. 🤔",
