    "body": "I also have Windows 10 1909 and beta unicode enabled and starship is fast. I think the stucking happens because starship is slow to return the prompt. The shell being stuck until starship is done is likely just how powershell handles prompts.\r\n\r\nIt looks like you have the memory usage module enabled. I think it's possible that that module is the cause of the slowdown. I'll try to test that theory tomorrow.",
